msgctxt "124"
msgid "Hey, you! Stop right there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "It's okay. He's with me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "...Detective Date?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Ex-detective, actually. Been off the force for a while now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Oh! My apologies. So, is this man an acquaintance of yours?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"Yup, I'm showing him the sights. Not too often an Okinawa\r\n"
"boy like him gets up to Tokyo, you know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "Oh, of course!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"Just... be careful, okay? We're currently hot on the tail of\r\n"
"a man suspected of a murder at the Millennium Tower."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "Heavy stuff. Yeah, I'll keep an eye out. Thanks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "Farewell, sir!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Thought I told you not to draw attention to yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "...Right. Sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"It's fine. Let's keep moving, Kiryu. And this time be\r\n"
"a little more careful, will you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "...Yeah. Sorry again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "Hey, stop right there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "What's the big hurry, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "Uh... nothing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid ""
"Suuure. That's what they all say. I'm gonna need you to\r\n"
"come with me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "(I really don't need this right now...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "Here, just talk to Date...san? Where'd Date-san go?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "(Great, we got separated.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid ""
"If you're looking for someone, he's not here. Sorry, but me\r\n"
"and you are taking a little trip to the station."
msgstr ""

